{title: 364 - O Jesus Christ, to You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #364 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 364}
{meta: category Christian Church - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]O [Gm/Bb]Jesus [Eb/Bb]Christ, to [Bb]You may [F/A]hymns be [Gm]rising
[Bb]In every [Am]city [Gm]for [F/A]Your [Gm/Bb]love [Dm]and [Cm]care;
[Cm]Inspire our [Gm]worship, grant the [Bb/F]glad [F7/Eb]surprising
[Eb]That Your [F7/Eb]blest Spirit [Bb]brings [Cm]men [Dm]everywhere.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Grant [Gm/Bb]us [Bb]new [Eb/Bb]courage, [Bb]Vsacrificial, [Gm]humble,
[Bb]Strong in Your [Am]strength [Dm]to [Gm]venture and [Dm]to [Cm]dare,
[Cm]To lift the [Gm]fallen, guide the [Bb/F]feet [F7/Eb]that [Dm]stumbe,
[Eb]Seek out [F7/Eb]the lonely [Cm]and [Dm]God's [Eb]mercy [Bb]share.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]Show [Gm/Bb]us [Bb]Your [Eb/Bb]Spirit, [Bb]brooding [F/A]o'er each [Gm]city,
[Bb]As You did [Am]weep [Dm]above [F/A]Jerusalem,
[Cm]Seeking to [Gm]gather all in [Bb/F]love [F7/Eb]and [Dm]pity,
[Eb]And [F7/Eb]healing [Bb/D]those who [Cm]touch [Dm]Your [Eb]garment's [Bb]hem.
{end_of_verse}
